01:18:06.145 --> 01:18:10.399
Take that cocaine,
put it in our case and shut it.


01:18:14.354 --> 01:18:16.405
Tick, tick, tick, tick...


01:18:18.759 --> 01:18:21.094
Oh, here we go, nice and easy.


01:18:21.194 --> 01:18:23.997
- Nice and easy, watch your step.
- You're in control, boss.


01:18:24.097 --> 01:18:26.366
- Fuck you.
- Dave, you got this?


01:18:26.466 --> 01:18:28.934
- I got it.
- Good.


01:18:29.034 --> 01:18:32.887
Easy, don't move,
don't fucking move, you hear me?


01:18:36.009 --> 01:18:37.978
It was nice meeting you, all of you!


01:18:38.078 --> 01:18:40.166
Hold on to this.


01:18:40.266 --> 01:18:42.698
Shit! Oh! Oh, shit!


01:18:48.722 --> 01:18:51.007
Oh, fuck.


01:19:04.204 --> 01:19:07.807
The fuck y'all running to?
You motherfuckers fired!


01:19:07.907 --> 01:19:10.158
All of y'all are fired.


01:19:15.982 --> 01:19:18.252
- That's right, it's the Muffin Man.
- <i>You find that cocaine?</i>


01:19:18.452 --> 01:19:20.454
- Just put Spyder on the phone!
- <i>Go fuck yourself!</i>


01:19:20.554 --> 01:19:24.992
No, I will not go fuck myself, Oscar.
Just tell Spyder that I got his coke...


01:19:25.092 --> 01:19:27.794
...and I want my dog and my money, all right?


01:19:27.894 --> 01:19:31.124
So I'll be over there tonight.
All right, goodbye.


01:19:31.998 --> 01:19:33.230
Well, that was easy.


01:19:33.330 --> 01:19:36.620
Yeah, easy getting in,
not so easy getting out.


01:19:36.720 --> 01:19:39.539
- It sure smells like a set-up.
- You got a plan?


01:19:39.939 --> 01:19:41.942
Of course, I got a plan.


01:19:42.342 --> 01:19:45.078
You see what's happening here, don't you?


01:19:45.178 --> 01:19:48.719
For the first time in your life,
Katey and Taylor...


01:19:48.819 --> 01:19:52.869
...you're putting them
and their needs before your own.


01:19:54.019 --> 01:19:56.690
Now me, I'm doing the totally opposite thing.


01:19:56.790 --> 01:20:01.076
I'm putting my needs before anyone else's
for the first time in my life.


01:20:02.762 --> 01:20:06.182
I've become you, and you've become me.


01:20:08.435 --> 01:20:12.155
- It's a little right on the nose, isn't it?
- Sure, but I didn't have much time with it.


01:20:14.708 --> 01:20:17.444
Great news! Jesus! It's me, it's okay.


01:20:17.544 --> 01:20:19.779
What the fuck are you doing here, John?


01:20:20.659 --> 01:20:22.865
I have something for you guys.


01:20:24.518 --> 01:20:26.387
Hi, guys.


01:20:27.687 --> 01:20:32.225
Fellas, you're a day early,
the luau has been changed 'til tomorrow.


01:20:32.325 --> 01:20:35.128
- Fuck you!
- Hey, Manu? Just... please.


01:20:35.228 --> 01:20:38.013
- Sorry. Sorry.
- Okay? It's okay.


01:20:39.366 --> 01:20:41.796
Listen, we are here...


01:20:41.896 --> 01:20:45.439
...to apologize to you, Steve
for kicking the shit out of you.


01:20:45.539 --> 01:20:47.923
Yeah, little dude says we should.


01:20:49.009 --> 01:20:51.412
Why are you listening to the little dude?


01:20:52.612 --> 01:20:54.696
He's dating our sister.


01:20:57.017 --> 01:20:58.851
How many sisters do you have?


01:20:58.951 --> 01:21:00.788
Only one.


01:21:01.888 --> 01:21:05.792
Yeah, yeah, it just happened,
just crazy chemistry...


01:21:05.892 --> 01:21:09.033
...just right off the bat.
Just very... very heated...


01:21:09.133 --> 01:21:12.098
...in a respectable way, just modest...


01:21:12.198 --> 01:21:16.016
- ...modests, hot modests.
- Why didn't you just beat the shit out of him?


01:21:16.116 --> 01:21:19.773
- Momma likes him.
- You met Nola's mom?


01:21:19.873 --> 01:21:23.800
Yeah, yeah, uh, just yesterday,
actually... a very lovely lunch.


01:21:24.110 --> 01:21:27.113
Joan... is a wonderful cook.


01:21:27.713 --> 01:21:32.767
And it turns out, we both have
a passion for vintage cinema, so...


01:21:36.222 --> 01:21:39.292
- So we're all good here?
- Yeah, we're cool.


01:21:39.692 --> 01:21:42.324
- And?
- Oh.


01:21:42.763 --> 01:21:44.491
We owe you, Steve...


01:21:44.591 --> 01:21:48.050
...and if there's anything you need,
you could come see us.


01:21:49.969 --> 01:21:52.135
What are you guys doing right now?


01:21:52.235 --> 01:21:55.075
<i>I know I'm in the minority here,
but I don't love gun battles...</i>


01:21:55.225 --> 01:21:57.627
<i>...at creepy, drug-cartel trap houses.</i>


01:21:57.727 --> 01:22:02.265
<i>If anything, I'm more of an "au natural,"
hand-to-hand combat kind of guy.</i>


01:22:02.365 --> 01:22:06.843
<i>So, I just sat this one out and headed
back to the office. You know...</i>


01:22:06.943 --> 01:22:08.954
<i>...to do office stuff.</i>


01:22:23.102 --> 01:22:26.840
Here you go, buddy.
Hold tight, okay, come on.


01:22:26.940 --> 01:22:29.170
Ssh, let's get out of here.


01:22:46.592 --> 01:22:47.632
Right?


01:22:51.364 --> 01:22:52.568
Whoa!


01:22:57.370 --> 01:22:59.839
Not much of a plan, if I can say that.


01:22:59.939 --> 01:23:03.443
Stay here with the coke.
I'm gonna try and get Buddy.


01:23:03.543 --> 01:23:05.178
Keep your head down.


01:23:05.278 --> 01:23:07.562
Picked the right man for the job.


01:23:11.451 --> 01:23:13.301
Get some!


01:23:20.560 --> 01:23:22.411
Fuck you.


01:23:28.334 --> 01:23:31.171
- What the fuck, Holmes?
- It's that Muffin motherfucker, man!


01:23:31.271 --> 01:23:33.006
He's back, took a shot at me!


01:23:33.106 --> 01:23:36.190
Watch the windows,
I'll find that muffinfucker!


01:23:51.224 --> 01:23:53.094
Drop the gun.


01:23:58.331 --> 01:24:01.619
Does Spyder know you and Lupe
stole all the drugs?


01:24:01.719 --> 01:24:03.480
And you've been fucking her?


01:24:03.580 --> 01:24:05.420
Where's my coke, bitch?


01:24:09.943 --> 01:24:12.198
You lying motherfucker.


01:24:28.595 --> 01:24:30.464
Now what?


01:24:31.064 --> 01:24:34.334
We had a deal... your doggie
and the money for my cocaine.


01:24:34.434 --> 01:24:36.970
- Yeah.
- You got my coke?


01:24:37.070 --> 01:24:39.121
It's on it's way.


01:24:39.221 --> 01:24:40.694
It's okay.


01:24:41.708 --> 01:24:43.377
Bring it on, motherfucker!


01:24:43.477 --> 01:24:46.012
- Dave, Dave!
- What the fuck are you doing?


01:24:46.112 --> 01:24:48.514
I'm completely out of control.


01:24:48.614 --> 01:24:51.219
All right, that's our guy.


01:24:53.219 --> 01:24:55.021
Is that for me?


01:24:55.121 --> 01:24:58.739
Yes, here we go. I got it, I got it.


01:25:04.564 --> 01:25:07.818
Dude... okay. Thank you.


01:25:07.918 --> 01:25:09.451
Mm.


01:25:14.568 --> 01:25:16.759
Hang on to that.


01:25:37.697 --> 01:25:40.400
There he is, come here.


01:25:40.500 --> 01:25:43.169
Buddy! I missed you so much!


01:25:43.869 --> 01:25:45.938
You been feeding my dog?


01:25:46.038 --> 01:25:48.808
Pedigree, lamb and rice blend,
he loves that shit.


01:25:48.908 --> 01:25:52.878
Yeah, he does. Thanks for looking after him.


01:25:52.978 --> 01:25:54.781
No problem.


01:25:55.281 --> 01:25:57.532
- We cool?
- Cool.


01:25:58.732 --> 01:26:02.711
- See you down the road, Holmes.
- All right, okay.


01:26:03.489 --> 01:26:05.741
Not a bad fella, that Spyder.


01:26:11.030 --> 01:26:13.433
<i>So, Steve got the job done.</i>


01:26:13.533 --> 01:26:16.102
<i>Was it unorthodox in execution? Sure.</i>


01:26:16.202 --> 01:26:19.727
<i>Should he see someone about multiple
concussions in a span of 24 hours?</i>


01:26:19.827 --> 01:26:23.109
