maybe a therapist to help him...</i>


01:26:23.209 --> 01:26:26.546
<i>...sort out some of his many issues?
That's not for me to say.</i>


01:26:26.646 --> 01:26:28.422
<i>The main thing is...</i>


01:26:28.642 --> 01:26:30.920
<i>...Steve got his dog back.</i>


01:26:31.551 --> 01:26:33.746
<i>Lew the Jew made good on his deal...</i>


01:26:33.846 --> 01:26:36.796
<i>...and me, I got the girl.</i>


01:26:36.896 --> 01:26:39.125
<i>Never thought I'd get to say that.</i>


01:26:40.225 --> 01:26:41.962
She's all yours.


01:26:42.062 --> 01:26:44.817
You, uh, take good care of her, huh?


01:26:44.917 --> 01:26:47.333
- I will, Lew.
- Okay.


01:26:47.433 --> 01:26:50.037
- Thank you very much.
- Yeah.


01:26:51.737 --> 01:26:53.573
You did the right thing.


01:26:54.595 --> 01:26:56.117
Nah.


01:27:03.549 --> 01:27:05.285
- Hey.
- Hey.


01:27:05.385 --> 01:27:07.257
Hi, baby.


01:27:08.760 --> 01:27:10.785
Do you like your new room?


01:27:10.885 --> 01:27:13.056
My new room is...


01:27:13.156 --> 01:27:16.173
...pretty amazing. Thanks, Uncle Steve.


01:27:16.696 --> 01:27:18.532
You're welcome.


01:27:18.632 --> 01:27:20.717
Have a good time today.


01:27:24.069 --> 01:27:26.121
Thought you might want that.


01:27:28.942 --> 01:27:30.792
Thank you.


01:27:36.983 --> 01:27:40.460
Hot moo! Moo!


01:27:41.788 --> 01:27:43.523
I'll take a steak.


01:27:43.623 --> 01:27:46.878
<i>Either way, everyone is happy.</i>


01:27:47.993 --> 01:27:50.240
<i>Case closed.</i>


01:27:53.131 --> 01:27:56.017
- Hello.
- <i>Steve, it's me, it's John.</i>


01:27:57.337 --> 01:28:01.141
- I can't hear you very well. Who is this?
- <i>Here, I got you. It's John.</i>


01:28:01.241 --> 01:28:04.043
Yeah, uh, look, I know everyone
is probably looking forward...


01:28:04.143 --> 01:28:06.622
...to my world-famous pasta salad...


01:28:06.722 --> 01:28:09.650
...but I won't be able to make it.


01:28:09.750 --> 01:28:12.919
<i>So I invite you to my party,
and you're not gonna bring anything?</i>


01:28:13.019 --> 01:28:16.022
I won't be able to attend the barbeque...
pasta salad's already made.


01:28:16.122 --> 01:28:18.224
<i>Okay, no worries, pal, I'll see you tomorrow.</i>


01:28:18.924 --> 01:28:20.727
Well, yeah...


01:28:20.827 --> 01:28:22.320
Hello?


01:28:24.792 --> 01:28:26.299
Steve?


01:28:28.795 --> 01:28:30.603
I believe he hung up.


01:28:31.203 --> 01:28:35.541
That's terrible, because if he's not gonna
come to us, now we gotta go to him...


01:28:35.641 --> 01:28:38.376
...which means you need
to tell us where he is.


01:28:39.879 --> 01:28:41.486
No.


01:28:41.586 --> 01:28:45.952
No, I won't. So, you're just
gonna have to find him...


01:28:46.052 --> 01:28:49.265
...and you won't be able to find Steve.
Not in Venice.


01:28:49.615 --> 01:28:52.485
He knows every nook and cranny
in this neighborhood. He'll disappear...


01:28:52.585 --> 01:28:57.230
...he's got friends in high places,
and got friends in low places.


01:28:57.330 --> 01:28:59.913
I didn't mean to quote
that country song right now but...


01:29:00.013 --> 01:29:04.971
...the point is, if he even gets a whiff
of trouble, he'll turn into a ghost.


01:29:05.071 --> 01:29:07.073
Not literally, obviously, but...


01:29:07.173 --> 01:29:09.490
Hold on. Clancy...


01:29:09.590 --> 01:29:12.212
...rewind that shit back
like... like a minute.


01:29:12.312 --> 01:29:16.516
What's the address of that house
we scored from Lew the Jew?


01:29:17.416 --> 01:29:21.821
<i>I'm standing in Steve's parents'
house at 845 Holland Canal...</i>


01:29:21.921 --> 01:29:25.992
<i>...the one with the white picket fence.
I think it's mid-century.</i>


01:29:26.092 --> 01:29:30.033
Really? And you know,
it's perfect timing because I'm starving...


01:29:30.133 --> 01:29:32.265
...and I really love pasta salad.


01:29:32.365 --> 01:29:34.967
I hear yours is world-renowned.


01:29:35.667 --> 01:29:39.059
You guys hungry?
Y'all ready to go eat? Yeah, okay?


01:29:39.159 --> 01:29:41.774
We're going to a party, white boy.


01:29:41.874 --> 01:29:44.391
Oh, God. Please don't.


01:29:45.411 --> 01:29:47.317
Actually... let's go.


01:29:47.417 --> 01:29:51.232
Thank you... thank you
for not shooting my balls.


01:29:56.990 --> 01:29:59.059
Okay, well, I'll just be here.


01:31:02.088 --> 01:31:03.526
No.
		
